flowchart TD
    U["User wallet<br/>the only signer and fee payer"]
    P["pre-req-vault program<br/>HZbxjG93...wmsw<br/>1 initialize · 2 deposit · 3 withdraw · 4 close"]
    VS["vault_state (our PDA)<br/>seeds: state + user<br/>stores vault_bump + state_bump"]
    SP["System Program<br/>moves every lamport"]
    V["vault (our PDA)<br/>seeds: vault + vault_state<br/>SystemAccount, holds the SOL"]
    REG["registration program<br/>TRBZyQHB...KWDM"]
    APP["application_account (their PDA)<br/>seeds: prereqs + user<br/>records: Anshumancanrock"]

    U -->|calls an instruction| P
    P -->|"1 creates it · 4 closes it, rent back to user"| VS
    P -->|"CPI on 2, 3 and 4"| SP
    P -->|"CPI on 3 only, the Task 2 call<br/>initialize(github), no extra signer"| REG
    SP -->|"2 SOL in: the user's own signature<br/>3 and 4 SOL out: program signs with vault seeds"| V
    REG -->|creates| APP

    classDef ext fill:#fde8d0,stroke:#c2680f,color:#4a2c0a
    class REG,APP ext
